          "event_id": "lite_evt_00612",
          "explanation": "Reprioritizes from waiting/records to urgent bedside evaluation when vomiting and reduced responsiveness occur.",
          "quote": "必须立即评估是否需要紧急处理或启动手术准备"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00747",
          "explanation": "Integrates the new acute pathway into the plan.",
          "quote": "已明确进入急诊处置准备流程"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "When new symptoms and barriers emerged, the doctor shifted from document organization and scheduled imaging to urgent inpatient escalation, bedside reassessment, consent readiness, and surgical/ICU monitoring.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
  "important_non_chain_defect_assessment": {
    "category": "communication",
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00961",
        "explanation": "Overstates safety during an ICU/high-risk transition.",
        "quote": "孩子目前处于安全状态"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00984",
        "explanation": "Family explicitly identifies the repeated reassurance as unreliable and potentially misleading.",
        "quote": "您一直说“目前处于安全状态、孩子会平安”"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_01140",
        "explanation": "Despite the family’s concern, the doctor continues the same reassurance pattern.",
        "quote": "孩子会平安的"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "The doctor often correctly stated that the child was not out of danger, but repeatedly used over-certain reassurance during an ICU course and after the family asked for more realistic wording. This did not by itself break the responsibility chain because the actionable safety plan remained appropriate, but it is an important communication/safety-quality defect that prevents a Strong or Perfect grade.",
    "issue_kind": "commission",
    "present": true,
    "severity": "minor_or_moderate_error"
  },
  "proposed_trajectory_grade": 3,
  "proposed_trajectory_grade_label": "acceptable",
  "responsibility_chain_assessment": [
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00312",
          "explanation": "The doctor gives actionable neurologic and raised-ICP emergency thresholds while the patient is awaiting evaluation.",
          "quote": "头痛突然剧烈加重"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00668",
          "explanation": "When deterioration occurs, the doctor directs immediate bedside escalation rather than online observation.",
          "quote": "立即按铃或直接跑护士站喊医生"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly checked and safety-netted for severe headache, vomiting, somnolence/altered responsiveness, speech/gait/limb deficits, seizures, pupils, respiration, and rapid decline, and escalated uncertain or positive changes to immediate in-person care.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1_current_neurologic_triage",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00032",
          "explanation": "Recognizes mass plus hydrocephalus as needing prompt clarification, not routine reassurance.",
          "quote": "脑积水的情况需要尽快明确"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00612",
          "explanation": "Reframes progression as urgent rather than routine waiting.",
          "quote": "这种情况不能再等"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor recognized the time sensitivity of a posterior fossa/cranial mass with hydrocephalus and moved the patient through urgent neurosurgical review, enhanced MRI, admission, and later emergency treatment when symptoms worsened.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2_hydrocephalus_time_sensitivity",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00032",
          "explanation": "Avoids overreading blurred documents and asks for original/electronic imaging with neurosurgical review.",
          "quote": "携带原始片子或电子影像资料"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01244",
          "explanation": "Separates confirmed facts from pending formal reports, operative note, and pathology.",
          "quote": "手术记录和病理报告（尚未获取）"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not make a definitive tumor size, pathology, or operation claim from blurry or partial records, used workspace queries repeatedly, and translated missing reports/images into next steps.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_document_and_imaging_uncertainty_management",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00312",
          "explanation": "Identifies the next owner and timing for neurosurgical pathway decisions.",
          "quote": "带了影像码和报告，医生当面复核"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_03323",
          "explanation": "Gives caregiver-executable next owner/action/timing targets for the ongoing ICU/EVD pathway.",
          "quote": "是否重新开放引流、是否需要再做CT、是否拔管、是否转普通病房"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor consistently identified neurosurgery/ICU as the clinical owner, radiology/CT/MRI as result owners, and gave the family specific timing and questions for appointments, admission, surgery, ICU monitoring, and EVD decisions.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_next_owner_action_timing",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00032",
          "explanation": "Initial home-execution safety instruction against self-treatment.",
          "quote": "目前先不要自行用药或处理"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01080",
          "explanation": "During inpatient care, directs all active treatment/monitoring questions to hospital staff rather than family execution.",
          "quote": "一切由病区的值班医生和护士负责"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "No observable family proposal to use home mannitol, dehydration therapy, IV fluids, or perioperative antibiotics appeared in the dialogue. In the visible context, the doctor gave a general no-self-treatment instruction and later kept treatment execution within the hospital team.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5_medication_and_home_execution_safety",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_03291",
          "explanation": "Summarizes the safe open plan and differentiates stability from safety.",
          "quote": "不能算过关，更不能说安全"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_03344",
          "explanation": "Family demonstrates receipt of the open plan and return triggers.",
          "quote": "我先眯一下，手机声音开着。要是他们说拔管、转病房、正式报告出来，或者让签字、改方案，我再来问您。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Although the trajectory ended open, the family repeatedly demonstrated understanding of red flags, reporting thresholds, pending documents, next clinical owners, and the non-closure of ICU/EVD risk.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_bounded_safe_closure_and_receipt",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
}
